    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a &quot;Deck-Building Liver Development Card Game.&quot;<br>You will nurture aspiring livestreamers (Livers) and help them become outstanding Livers. The deadline is two weeks.<br>The goal is to earn as many LP (Liver Points) as possible.<br>To achieve this, you must use your cards efficiently and build an optimized deck.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start with a set of predetermined cards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use these cards to acquire more cards from the field = Deck-Building.<br>(Cards become stronger when leveled up.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simultaneously, you will need to raise the Liver's stats.<br>(Card effects are enhanced based on the Liver's stats.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each turn, LP (Liver Points) will be awarded based on the Liver's stats.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The title screen in the game includes a &quot;Tutorial.&quot;<br>If you're unsure about anything, check the specific section of the &quot;Tutorial.&quot;<br>(There are not only images but also videos, so feel free to watch them.)</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not sure what to do?<br>Read the &quot;Game Objective&quot; section.<br>Then, go through the sections under &quot;What You Can Do During Your Turn&quot; in order.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't understand the layout of the field?<br>Check the &quot;Understanding the Field&quot; section.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unsure how to read the cards?<br>Look at the &quot;About Cards&quot; section.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What are Liver's stats?<br>Review the &quot;About Liver's Stats&quot; section.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;<u><strong>Contact us here:</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >X (formerly Twitter)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Honewa_Game (@HonewaGame) / X</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Email</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><a href=\"mailto:kee37432a78hp8ae05s@gmail.com&quot;\">kee37432a78hp8ae05s@gmail.com&quot;</a></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a &quot;Deck-Building Liver Development Card Game.&quot;<br>You will nurture aspiring livestreamers (Livers) and help them become outstanding Livers. The deadline is two weeks.<br>The goal is to earn as many LP (Liver Points) as possible.<br>To achieve this, you must use your cards efficiently and build an optimized deck.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start with a set of predetermined cards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use these cards to acquire more cards from the field = Deck-Building.<br>(Cards become stronger when leveled up.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simultaneously, you will need to raise the Liver's stats.<br>(Card effects are enhanced based on the Liver's stats.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each turn, LP (Liver Points) will be awarded based on the Liver's stats.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The title screen in the game includes a &quot;Tutorial.&quot;<br>If you're unsure about anything, check the specific section of the &quot;Tutorial.&quot;<br>(There are not only images but also videos, so feel free to watch them.)</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not sure what to do?<br>Read the &quot;Game Objective&quot; section.<br>Then, go through the sections under &quot;What You Can Do During Your Turn&quot; in order.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't understand the layout of the field?<br>Check the &quot;Understanding the Field&quot; section.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unsure how to read the cards?<br>Look at the &quot;About Cards&quot; section.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What are Liver's stats?<br>Review the &quot;About Liver's Stats&quot; section.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;<u><strong>Contact us here:</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >X (formerly Twitter)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Honewa_Game (@HonewaGame) / X</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Email</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><a href=\"mailto:kee37432a78hp8ae05s@gmail.com&quot;\">kee37432a78hp8ae05s@gmail.com&quot;</a></p>",
